Third-party components
----------------------

1. sdecast/nets.py -- SongUNet backbone
   Adapted from "Elucidating the Design Space of Diffusion-Based Generative
   Models" (EDM), Tero Karras, Miika Aittala, Timo Aila, Samuli Laine (NVIDIA).
   https://github.com/NVlabs/edm
   Upstream is released under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, which is why this repository as a
   whole carries the same terms. Modifications: circular padding for periodic
   domains (both axes for SQG, longitude only for ERA5), configurable attention
   levels, and a linear time-embedding variant.

2. sdecast/sqg/solver.py -- SQG pseudo-spectral solver
   From the sqgturb package by Jeff Whitaker (NOAA),
   jeffrey.s.whitaker@noaa.gov, https://github.com/jswhit/sqgturb
   A work of the US federal government, in the public domain. Modifications:
   packaging only.

3. sample_data/era5_*.nc -- ERA5 reanalysis
   Contains modified Copernicus Climate Change Service information (2018).
   Generated using Copernicus Climate Change Service information. Neither the
   European Commission nor ECMWF is responsible for any use of this data.
   Redistributed here as a small slice under the Copernicus licence:
   https://cds.climate.copernicus.eu/disclaimer-privacy


